      "details": "Create a new helper class ElementCollector in the same package. This class will host a small set of element-collection query methods moved from Element that directly call Collector.collect / Collector.findFirst with Evaluator instances. The extracted class should be implemented so methods accept an Element context (either instance methods constructed with the Element or static helpers that take an Element parameter) to preserve behavior without leaving Collector/Evaluator references in Element.",
      "risk": "medium"
    },
